Troubleshooting & Validation Notes
Check / Potential Issue	Verification / Resolution
ConfigMap key naming	Ensure the key inside my-redis-config is explicitly redis-config (not redis.conf) so /redis-master/redis-config resolves as expected by the validator.
Volume & mount names	Match exact volume identifiers: data (emptyDir) at /redis-master-data and redis-config (configMap: my-redis-config) at /redis-master.
Scheduling with 1 CPU request	Verified kubectl rollout status completed immediately (1/1 Running) with zero Insufficient cpu events.
